# No Workarounds

**Never use `--no-verify`** with git commands. Fix the underlying problem instead of bypassing hooks.

**Never set environment variables** to skip checks or logic. Do not suggest or use patterns like `SKIP_*`, `DISABLE_*`, `CI=true` to bypass validation—fix the cause instead.
